WEBVTT

00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:00.375
Allan: No.

00:12:01.625 --> 00:12:02.893
I didn't.

00:12:02.917 --> 00:12:04.601
DB: Then it's an "I"?
Allan: Correct.

00:12:04.625 --> 00:12:06.309
DB: But you had a B.
Allan: Yes.

00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:08.768
DB: Yeah, he changed his mind.
He changed his mind.

00:12:08.792 --> 00:12:10.101
(Laughter)

00:12:10.125 --> 00:12:13.059
So see it written there.

00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:15.893
Just keep saying it
to yourself in your head.

00:12:15.917 --> 00:12:17.375
Oh, you play drums, don't you.

00:12:18.167 --> 00:12:19.434
Allan: I do.

00:12:19.458 --> 00:12:22.393
DB: Just get that out of your head,
get that out of your head,

00:12:22.417 --> 00:12:24.184
just focus on this one thing for me.

00:12:24.208 --> 00:12:26.393
(Laughter)

00:12:26.417 --> 00:12:28.226
My job is to sell you a story, right?

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:31.101
I try and do this to all of you,
to get you to pay attention